# Legends of the Twins — character traits, pp.7-11. Variant (p.7): a player may choose up to two traits at character creation; no character may have more than two. Traits are not normally gained later without the DM's approval.
Abrasive	KEY:Trait ~ Abrasive	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are difficult and demanding in conversation, which tends to oppress those around you.	BENEFIT:+1 on Intimidate checks. Drawback: -1 on Diplomacy and Bluff checks.	BONUS:SKILL|Intimidate|1	BONUS:SKILL|Diplomacy,Bluff|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.7
Absent Minded	KEY:Trait ~ Absent Minded	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are fascinated by knowledge and learning and think quickly, but your preoccupation makes you less aware of your surroundings.	BENEFIT:+1 on Knowledge checks (this does not let you use a Knowledge skill untrained). Drawback: -1 on Spot and Listen checks.	BONUS:SKILL|TYPE.Knowledge|1	BONUS:SKILL|Spot,Listen|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.7
Aggressive	KEY:Trait ~ Aggressive	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are quick to start a fight and press the attack, sometimes leaving yourself open.	BENEFIT:+2 on initiative checks. Drawback: -1 to Armor Class.	BONUS:COMBAT|INITIATIVE|2	BONUS:COMBAT|AC|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.8
Brawler	KEY:Trait ~ Brawler	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You close with foes, grabbing and punching rather than using weapons.	BENEFIT:+1 on unarmed attack rolls and grapple checks. Drawback: -1 on all other attack rolls. Special: not for natural weapons. A character with Improved Unarmed Strike cannot take this trait, and loses it on gaining that feat.	SOURCEPAGE:p.8
Cautious	KEY:Trait ~ Cautious	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are careful, even a bit cowardly, in combat, which leaves you open to fear.	BENEFIT:An additional +1 dodge bonus to AC whenever you fight defensively or take the total defense action. Drawback: -1 on saves against fear effects. Special: not if you are immune to fear; you lose the benefit if you later gain immunity to fear.	SOURCEPAGE:p.8
Delicate	KEY:Trait ~ Delicate	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are light on your feet and graceful, but your slight frame makes you frail.	BENEFIT:+1 on Reflex saves. Drawback: -1 on Fortitude saves.	BONUS:SAVE|Reflex|1	BONUS:SAVE|Fortitude|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.8
Detached	KEY:Trait ~ Detached	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You keep a distance from events that grounds you but slows your reactions.	BENEFIT:+1 on Will saves. Drawback: -1 on Reflex saves.	BONUS:SAVE|Will|1	BONUS:SAVE|Reflex|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.8
Dishonest	KEY:Trait ~ Dishonest	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You lie easily but struggle to be believed when you tell the truth.	BENEFIT:+1 on Bluff checks. Drawback: -2 on Diplomacy checks.	BONUS:SKILL|Bluff|1	BONUS:SKILL|Diplomacy|-2	SOURCEPAGE:p.8
Easygoing	KEY:Trait ~ Easygoing	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are naturally friendly, which makes it harder to be pushy or suspicious.	BENEFIT:+1 on Gather Information checks. Drawback: -1 on Intimidate and Sense Motive checks.	BONUS:SKILL|Gather Information|1	BONUS:SKILL|Intimidate,Sense Motive|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.8
Farsighted	KEY:Trait ~ Farsighted	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:Your distance vision is keen, but you struggle to focus on nearby objects.	BENEFIT:+1 on Spot checks. Drawback: -2 on Search checks.	BONUS:SKILL|Spot|1	BONUS:SKILL|Search|-2	SOURCEPAGE:p.8
Focused	KEY:Trait ~ Focused	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You keep your attention on a task despite distractions, but miss what goes on around you.	BENEFIT:+1 on Concentration checks. Drawback: -1 on Spot and Listen checks.	BONUS:SKILL|Concentration|1	BONUS:SKILL|Spot,Listen|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.8-9
Hard of Hearing	KEY:Trait ~ Hard of Hearing	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:A slight hearing impairment has sharpened your other senses.	BENEFIT:+1 on Spot checks. Drawback: -2 on Listen checks.	BONUS:SKILL|Spot|1	BONUS:SKILL|Listen|-2	SOURCEPAGE:p.9
Hardy	KEY:Trait ~ Hardy	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are tougher than most, but slower to react to danger.	BENEFIT:+1 on Fortitude saves. Drawback: -1 on Reflex saves.	BONUS:SAVE|Fortitude|1	BONUS:SAVE|Reflex|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.9
Honest	KEY:Trait ~ Honest	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are straightforward and sincere, and find lies hard to tell or to see.	BENEFIT:+1 on Diplomacy checks. Drawback: -1 on Bluff and Sense Motive checks.	BONUS:SKILL|Diplomacy|1	BONUS:SKILL|Bluff,Sense Motive|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.9
Illiterate	KEY:Trait ~ Illiterate	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You cannot read, but have devoted yourself to other skills.	BENEFIT:Choose one skill other than Decipher Script or Forgery: +1 on checks with it. Drawback: you are illiterate. Special: spending 2 skill points makes you literate and removes the drawback; unlike a barbarian, you cannot become literate by taking a level in another class. Not available if you are already illiterate by race, class or any other reason.	SOURCEPAGE:p.9
Moonstruck	KEY:Trait ~ Moonstruck	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are attuned to the phases of Krynn's three moons, as the Wizards of High Sorcery are.	BENEFIT:+1 on saves against spells while the moon matching your alignment (Nuitari evil, Lunitari neutral, Solinari good) is in High Sanction. Drawback: -1 on saves against spells while that moon is in Low Sanction.	SOURCEPAGE:p.9
Musclebound	KEY:Trait ~ Musclebound	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You excel at tasks of strength but are clumsy at tasks of coordination.	BENEFIT:+1 on Strength-based skill checks and ability checks. Drawback: -2 on Dexterity-based skill checks and ability checks.	BONUS:SKILL|TYPE.Strength|1	BONUS:SKILL|TYPE.Dexterity|-2	SOURCEPAGE:p.9
Nearsighted	KEY:Trait ~ Nearsighted	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You have an eye for detail, but struggle to focus on distant objects.	BENEFIT:+1 on Search checks. Drawback: -1 on Spot checks.	BONUS:SKILL|Search|1	BONUS:SKILL|Spot|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.9
Nervous	KEY:Trait ~ Nervous	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are alert to threats, but your paranoia makes you easy to deceive.	BENEFIT:+1 on Reflex saves. Drawback: -1 on Will saves.	BONUS:SAVE|Reflex|1	BONUS:SAVE|Will|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.9
Passionate	KEY:Trait ~ Passionate	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are tougher than most, but highly suggestible.	BENEFIT:+1 on Fortitude saves. Drawback: -1 on Will saves.	BONUS:SAVE|Fortitude|1	BONUS:SAVE|Will|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.9
Pious	KEY:Trait ~ Pious	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are deeply devoted to your own faith and less comfortable with other faiths.	BENEFIT:+1 on Diplomacy checks with followers of your god (false gods included). Drawback: -2 on Diplomacy checks with followers of other gods. Special: requires a patron deity. If you change or lose your faith you lose both, and take -1 on Diplomacy checks with followers of your old religion. You may keep this trait while your god is absent (as in the early Age of Mortals).	SOURCEPAGE:p.10
Plucky	KEY:Trait ~ Plucky	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:Your strength of will is greater than your physical gifts.	BENEFIT:+1 on Will saves. Drawback: -1 on Fortitude saves.	BONUS:SAVE|Will|1	BONUS:SAVE|Fortitude|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.10
Polite	KEY:Trait ~ Polite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are courteous and well spoken.	BENEFIT:+1 on Diplomacy checks. Drawback: -2 on Intimidate checks.	BONUS:SKILL|Diplomacy|1	BONUS:SKILL|Intimidate|-2	SOURCEPAGE:p.10
Quick	KEY:Trait ~ Quick	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are fast, but less sturdy than most of your race.	BENEFIT:Base land speed +10 feet (if you have no land speed, your highest speed instead). Drawback: -1 hit point from each level's hit points, 1st included (a result of 0 is possible). Special: requires Constitution 4 or higher.	BONUS:HP|CURRENTMAX|-TL	BONUS:MOVEADD|TYPE.Walk|10	SOURCEPAGE:p.10
Reckless	KEY:Trait ~ Reckless	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You give up accuracy to put more power behind your blows.	BENEFIT:+1 on damage rolls after successful melee attacks. Drawback: -1 on melee attack rolls.	BONUS:COMBAT|MELEE.DAMAGE|1	BONUS:COMBAT|TOHIT.MELEE|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.10
Relentless	KEY:Trait ~ Relentless	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You go all out until you simply cannot continue.	BENEFIT:+2 on Constitution checks and similar checks to continue tiring activities (every check and save the Endurance feat covers). Drawback: anything that would make you fatigued makes you exhausted instead.	SOURCEPAGE:p.10
Saddleborn	KEY:Trait ~ Saddleborn	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are a natural rider, but impatient handling animals you are not riding.	BENEFIT:+1 on Ride checks. Drawback: -1 on Handle Animal checks.	BONUS:SKILL|Ride|1	BONUS:SKILL|Handle Animal|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.10
Skinny	KEY:Trait ~ Skinny	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are very slender for your race.	BENEFIT:+1 on Escape Artist checks. Drawback: -2 on Strength checks to avoid being bull rushed or overrun.	BONUS:SKILL|Escape Artist|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.10
Slippery	KEY:Trait ~ Slippery	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are a poor grappler but good at slipping out of a hold.	BENEFIT:+1 on Escape Artist checks to escape a grapple and on grapple checks to escape a grapple or avoid being grappled. Drawback: -1 on all other grapple checks.	SOURCEPAGE:p.10
Slow	KEY:Trait ~ Slow	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are slow, but sturdier than most of your race.	BENEFIT:+1 hit point at each level. Drawback: base land speed halved (rounded down to the nearest 5-foot interval). Special: requires a base land speed of at least 20 feet.	BONUS:HP|CURRENTMAX|TL	SOURCEPAGE:p.10-11
Specialized	KEY:Trait ~ Specialized	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You have a knack for one kind of work or study, at the expense of others.	BENEFIT:Choose one specific Craft, Knowledge or Profession skill: +1 on checks with it. Drawback: -2 on all other checks with that skill family (Craft, Knowledge or Profession, as chosen).	SOURCEPAGE:p.11
Stout	KEY:Trait ~ Stout	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are heavy for your race.	BENEFIT:+2 on Strength checks to avoid being bull rushed or overrun. Drawback: -1 on Escape Artist checks.	BONUS:SKILL|Escape Artist|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.11
Suspicious	KEY:Trait ~ Suspicious	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are suspicious of everyone and everything: hard to fool, but less persuasive.	BENEFIT:+1 on Sense Motive checks. Drawback: -1 on Diplomacy and Intimidate checks.	BONUS:SKILL|Sense Motive|1	BONUS:SKILL|Diplomacy,Intimidate|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.11
Torpid	KEY:Trait ~ Torpid	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You are sluggish to react, but resistant to others' commands.	BENEFIT:+1 on saves against enchantment (compulsion) effects. Drawback: -2 on initiative checks.	BONUS:COMBAT|INITIATIVE|-2	SOURCEPAGE:p.11
Uncivilized	KEY:Trait ~ Uncivilized	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Traits	DESC:You relate better to animals than to people.	BENEFIT:+1 on Handle Animal and wild empathy checks. Drawback: -1 on Bluff, Diplomacy and Gather Information checks.	BONUS:SKILL|Handle Animal|1	BONUS:SKILL|Bluff,Diplomacy,Gather Information|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.11
